visional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p008","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-yi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p008:m0142","start":44,"end":45,"surface":"方","kind":"person","person_id":"eti_fp9_fq5","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p008","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-yi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p009:m0148","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"張方","kind":"person","person_id":"eti_fp9_fq5","status":"contextual_provisional","resolution_note":"本完整敘事單元與本段引語之具體角色；詳隨附逐錨審閱。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-059-yi:p009","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-059-yi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p021:m0102","start":102,"end":104,"surface":"張方","kind":"person","person_id":"eti_fp9_fq5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"本單元明見人物；尚未原生匯入。","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family:p021","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-061-zhou-family"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[{"id":"th-w044-luzhi-13","person_id":"eti_fp9_fq5","title":"右將軍","kind":"office","mode":"attestation","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-luzhi","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line062","quote":"初，河間王顒聞王浚起兵，遣右將軍張方救鄴。方聞成都軍敗，頓兵洛陽，不敢進，縱兵虜掠，密欲遷都長安，將焚宗廟宮室，以絕人心。志說方曰：「昔董卓無道，焚燒洛陽，怨毒之聲，百年猶存，何為襲之！」乃止。方遂逼天子幸其壘。帝垂泣就輿，唯志侍側，曰：「陛下今日之事，當一從右將軍。臣駑怯，無所雲補，唯知盡微誠，不離左右而已。」停方壘三日便西，志復從至長安。穎被黜，志亦免官。","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line062:m0016"}],"attestations":[{"id":"th-w043-luzhi-13:a","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line062","start":13,"end":16,"surface":"右將軍","person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line062:m0016","usage":"narrative","date_expression":null}],"effective_period":{"start":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]},"end":{"status":"unknown","date_expression":null,"evidence":[]}},"interpretation_note":"本來源官稱或所任，未受另記。","status":"source_attested","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"add