u-044-luzhi:line062:m0113","start":113,"end":114,"surface":"志","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line062:m0158","start":158,"end":159,"surface":"方","kind":"person","person_id":"eti_fp9_fq5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line062:m0165","start":165,"end":166,"surface":"志","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line062:m0172","start":172,"end":173,"surface":"穎","kind":"person","person_id":"e81_f09_000","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line062:m0176","start":176,"end":177,"surface":"志","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"}],"source_position":{"first_line":62,"last_line":62,"revision_id":1775345},"source_quote":{"witness":"j44","quote":"　　初，河間王顒聞王浚起兵，遣右將軍張方救鄴。方聞成都軍敗，頓兵洛陽，不敢進，縱兵虜掠，密欲遷都長安，將焚宗廟宮室，以絕人心。志說方曰：「昔董卓無道，焚燒洛陽，怨毒之聲，百年猶存，何為襲之！」乃止。方遂逼天子幸其壘。帝垂泣就輿，唯志侍側，曰：「陛下今日之事，當一從右將軍。臣駑怯，無所雲補，唯知盡微誠，不離左右而已。」停方壘三日便西，志復從至長安。穎被黜，志亦免官。","raw_start":5053,"raw_end":5236,"raw_line":62},"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi","book_id":"b-jinshu-044","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-044-luzhi"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064","text":"及東海王越奉迎大駕，顒啟帝復穎還鄴，以志為魏郡太守，加左將軍，隨穎北鎮。行達洛陽，而平昌公模遣前鋒督護馮嵩距穎。穎還長安，未至而聞顒斬張方，求和於越。穎住華陰，志進長安，詣闕陳謝，即還就穎于武關。奔南陽，復為劉陶所驅，回詣河北。及穎薨，官屬奔散，唯志親自殯送，時人嘉之。越命志為軍諮祭酒，遷衛尉，永嘉末，轉尚書。洛陽沒，志將妻子北投并州刺史劉琨。至陽邑，為劉粲所虜，與次子謐、詵等俱遇害於平陽。長子諶。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0001","start":1,"end":5,"surface":"東海王越","kind":"person","person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0010","start":10,"end":11,"surface":"顒","kind":"person","person_id":"ed0_313_bea","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0014","start":14,"end":15,"surface":"穎","kind":"person","person_id":"e81_f09_000","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0019","start":19,"end":20,"surface":"志","kind":"person","person_id":"m8n_ntm_79h_ABB","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0032","start":32,"end":33,"surface":"穎","kind":"person","person_id":"e81_f09_000","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0042","start":42,"end":46,"surface":"平昌公模","kind":"person","person_id":"a6t_8s4_3jz","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0051","start":51,"end":53,"surface":"馮嵩","kind":"person","person_id":"4cf_cwf_cdc","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0054","start":54,"end":55,"surface":"穎","kind":"person","person_id":"e81_f09_000","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0056","start":56,"end":57,"surface":"穎","kind":"person","person_id":"e81_f09_000","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0065","start":65,"end":66,"surface":"顒","kind":"person","person_id":"ed0_313_bea","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"張方","kind":"person","person_id":"eti_fp9_fq5","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0073","start":73,"end":74,"surface":"越","kind":"person","person_id":"9o2_vhv_r7y","status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"以來源原字標記。"},{"id":"c-jinshu-044-luzhi:line064:m0075","start":75,"en